From e11f59c5de63243989b44d269dced7041f128eb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:44:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign chart engine for accessibility/interactivity; add
 missing create buttons for Risk Register and CAPA; add .gitignore

- tqm-charts.tsx: replace non-CVD-safe palette with a validated
  colorblind-safe palette (checked with the dataviz skill's
  validate_palette.js); TqmTrend is now interactive (hover crosshair,
  tooltip, keyboard nav, selective direct labels, "view as table"
  toggle for accessibility); TqmHorizontalBars/TqmGantt gain hover
  affordances. Shared by 17 pages app-wide, so this one fix lifts the
  whole app.
- risks/page.tsx, capa/page.tsx: both had a full create-record spec
  and backend insert path in /api/domain-records already, but no UI
  entry point at all (verified by code, not just screenshots) - wired
  in the same DomainCreateClient button used by Incidents/FMEA/etc.
- .gitignore: repo had none, so node_modules/.next showed as
  untracked after npm install; standard Next.js ignore list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015hVLqLVBtySF3HPQDPQvMw
